<http://data.silknow.org/production/4be01954-34f2-3ff4-ba7e-fbf3a62aaff5>
        a                       ecrm:E12_Production ;
        ecrm:P108_has_produced  <http://data.silknow.org/object/2d0db6b8-0134-3779-912b-9d894108f2b7> ;
        ecrm:P126_employed      "middle: more cotton weft visible"@en , "silk, ivory, 1 ply, slight S-twist. Weft: cotton, 1 ply, S-twist. Satin & Velvet warp order 3-1-3. Velvet structure, red and green silk, 1 bundle, no detectable twist. Pile counts, warps 12, along weft: 16. Binding weft threads: silk, super-skinny, white. Brocade structure: part brocaded"@en , "Woven silk brocade velvet, with vertical and horizontal point repeat with 4 minimum pattern areas. Satin foundation structure: 4/1 satin"@en , "outer: more silk warp visible. Silk warp visible in selvedges the same as satin warp."@en , "4/1 twill, count 20. Shots between pile: 2"@en , "warp count: 65"@en , "metal & twist: silver? Z.\nBrocaded only in the centre of the medallion and at the spandrels. Very little metal remains. Selvedges: dimensions 2 cms. 3 layers: inner most: more warp visible"@en ;
        ecrm:P126_employed      <http://data.silknow.org/vocabulary/900> , <http://data.silknow.org/vocabulary/617> ;
